# Upstream CoWork runtime source (supply-chain only, not committed)
work/vendor/
# Keep Trylo's narrow Control Plane compatibility bridge visible to Git. The
# rest of the large upstream checkout remains ignored; these two files must be
# reviewable and must travel with a packaged/fresh checkout.
